eslint/no-obj-calls Correctness ​✅ This rule is turned on by default. What it does ​Disallow calling some global objects as functionsWhy is this bad? ​Some global objects are not intended to be called as functions. Calling them as functions will usually result in a TypeError being thrown.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascriptlet math = Math();
