jsdoc/require-property Correctness ​What it does ​Requires that all @typedef and @namespace tags have @property tags when their type is a plain object, Object, or PlainObject.Note: this rule can be configured via jsdoc settings option.Why is this bad? ​Object type should have properties defined.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascript/**
 * @typedef {Object} SomeTypedef
 */

/**
 * @namespace {Object} SomeNamesoace
 */Examples of correct code for this rule:javascript/**
