nextjs/no-img-element Correctness ​🚧 An auto-fix is still under development. What it does ​Prevent the usage of <img> element due to slower LCP and higher bandwidth.Why is this bad? ​<img> elements are not optimized for performance and can result in slower LCP and higher bandwidth. Using <Image /> from next/image will automatically optimize images and serve them as static assets.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascriptexport function MyComponent() {
