eslint/no-div-regex Restriction ​🛠️ An auto-fix is available for this rule. What it does ​Disallow equal signs explicitly at the beginning of regular expressions.Why is this bad? ​Characters /= at the beginning of a regular expression literal can be confused with a division assignment operator.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascriptfunction bar() {
