  "rules": {
    "react/no-danger": "error"
  }
}References ​Rule Source

react/no-unknown-property Restriction ​🚧 An auto-fix is still under development. What it does ​Disallow usage of unknown DOM property.Why is this bad? ​You can use unknown property name that has no effect.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:jsx// Unknown properties
