eslint/sort-vars Pedantic ​🚧 An auto-fix is still under development. What it does ​When declaring multiple variables within the same block, sorting variable names make it easier to find necessary variable easier at a later time.Why is this bad? ​Unsorted variable declarations can make the code harder to read and maintain.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:jsvar b, a;
