jsdoc/require-param Pedantic ​What it does ​Requires that all function parameters are documented with JSDoc @param tags.Why is this bad? ​The rule is aimed at enforcing code quality and maintainability by requiring that all function parameters are documented.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascript/** @param foo */
