eslint/no-nested-ternary Style ​What it does ​Disallows nested ternary expressions to improve code readability and maintainability.Why is this bad? ​Nested ternary expressions make code harder to read and understand. They can lead to complex, difficult-to-debug logic.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:jsconst result = condition1 ? (condition2 ? "a" : "b") : "c";Examples of correct code for this rule:jslet result;
