import/no-named-default Style ​What it does ​Reports use of a default export as a locally named import.Why is this bad? ​Rationale: the syntax exists to import default exports expressively, let's use it.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:js// message: Using exported name 'bar' as identifier for default export.
