jest/no-confusing-set-timeout Style ​What it does ​Disallow confusing usages of jest.setTimeoutWhy is this bad? ​being called anywhere other than in global scopebeing called multiple timesbeing called after other Jest functions like hooks, describe, test, or itExample ​All of these are invalid case:javascriptescribe("test foo", () => {
