    "vitest/no-test-prefixes": "error"
  }
}How to use ​To enable this rule in the CLI or using the config file, you can use:CLIConfig (.oxlintrc.json)bashoxlint --deny jest/no-test-prefixes --jest-pluginjson{
  "plugins": ["jest"],
  "rules": {
    "jest/no-test-prefixes": "error"
  }
}References ​Rule Source

