typescript/ban-tslint-comment Style ​🛠️ An auto-fix is available for this rule. What it does ​This rule disallows tslint:<rule-flag> commentsWhy is this bad? ​Useful when migrating from TSLint to ESLint. Once TSLint has been removed, this rule helps locate TSLint annotationsExamples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:ts// tslint:disable-next-line
someCode();Examples of correct code for this rule:tssomeCode();How to use ​To enable this rule in the CLI or using the config file, you can use:CLIConfig (.oxlintrc.json)bashoxlint --deny typescript/ban-tslint-commentjson{
