unicorn/prefer-optional-catch-binding Style ​🛠️ An auto-fix is available for this rule. What it does ​Prefers omitting the catch binding parameter if it is unusedWhy is this bad? ​It is unnecessary to bind the error to a variable if it is not used.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascripttry {
