eslint/no-undef Nursery ​What it does ​Disallow the use of undeclared variables.Why is this bad? ​It is most likely a potential ReferenceError caused by a misspelling of a variable or parameter name.Examples ​Examples of incorrect code for this rule:javascriptvar foo = someFunction();
var bar = a + 1;How to use ​To enable this rule in the CLI or using the config file, you can use:CLIConfig (.oxlintrc.json)bashoxlint --deny no-undefjson{
